h2 POST /v1/drives/{drive_id}/documents
Name | Location | Value | Required
drive_id | path | string | Yes
Idempotency-Key | header | string | Yes
Field | Type | Presence | Guidance
documents | array of object | Required | 1–1,000 document records; external IDs must be distinct within the batch.
Field | Type | Presence | Guidance
external_id | string | Required | Your stable document identifier within this drive; at most 1,024 UTF-8 bytes.
text | string | Required | Document text, at most 2,000,000 UTF-8 bytes.
metadata | object | Optional | Flat labels, at most 64 fields and 8,000 encoded bytes. Replacement does not merge old labels.
folder_id | string or null | Optional | uuid
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
operation_id | string | Yes | uuid
documents | array of object | Optional | 
documents[].id | string | Yes | uuid
documents[].revision | string | Yes | 
usage | object | Yes | cost.amount is 0.000000; no ingestion fee.

