h2 GET /v1/sdk/context
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
workspace_id | string | Yes | uuid
permission | search, read_write | Yes | 
default_drive_id | string | Yes | uuid
default_version | string | Yes | 
compatibility | object | Yes | 
upload_batch | object | When bulk file requests are supported | SDK upload capability information.
upload_batch.version | integer | With upload_batch | Currently 1.
upload_batch.max_items | integer | With upload_batch | Currently 50.
upload_batch.max_body_bytes | integer | With upload_batch | Currently 65536.
compatibility.api_major | integer | Yes | 
compatibility.minimum_sdk_version | string | Yes | 
compatibility.latest_stable_sdk_version | string or null | Yes | 
compatibility.notices | array of object | Yes | 
compatibility.cli | object | Yes | CLI compatibility guidance.
compatibility.cli.api_major | integer | Yes | Supported API major version.
compatibility.cli.minimum_cli_version | string | Yes | Minimum supported CLI version.
compatibility.cli.latest_stable_cli_version | string or null | Yes | Latest stable version when available.
compatibility.cli.notices | array of object | Yes | Upgrade or deprecation notices with ID, severity, message, and optional effective date and documentation URL.
compatibility.notices[].id | string | Yes | 
compatibility.notices[].severity | upgrade, deprecation | Yes | 
compatibility.notices[].message | string | Yes | 
compatibility.notices[].effective_date | string | Yes | date-time
compatibility.notices[].documentation_url | string | Yes | uri